{"title":"Metal spike","sourceTitle":"Metal spike/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Metal_spike\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Metal spike (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Metal_spike/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Металлический шип (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Metal_spike/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"金属钉 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: rgba(120,90,60,0.4); border: 1px solid #7a7c7d; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<span class=\"mw-valign-middle\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Sapling-birch.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/a/a5/Sapling-birch.png/64px-Sapling-birch.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a5/Sapling-birch.png/96px-Sapling-birch.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a5/Sapling-birch.png/128px-Sapling-birch.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p><big><b>Este artigo é um esboço.</b></big><br />\nEste artigo não contém tantas informações quanto gostaríamos.\nSe desejar contribuir, você pode solicitar acesso de edição do wiki no <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.vintagestory.at/forums/topic/267-wiki-discussion/\">forum</a> ou no <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.gg/Tndr3w8\">Discord</a>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\nEspinhos de metal são um recurso que pode ser encontrado em ruínas e no solo sob ninhos de gafanhotos. Você pode quebrá-los com o punho ou com qualquer ferramenta, mas eles quebram mais rápido com uma picareta. Eles deixam cair peças de metal ou restos de metal.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>História antiga</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\">Guias</a><span style=\"display:none\">[[::Category:Guides| ]]</span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\">Perguntas frequentes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\">